{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03236","headline":"翫郡斋海榴 · 宋之问","name":"翫郡斋海榴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泽国韶气早，开帘延霁天。\n野禽宵未啭，山蜚昼仍眠。\n目兹海榴发，列暎岩楹前。\n熠爚御风静，葳蕤含景鲜。\n清晨绿堪佩，亭午丹欲然。\n昔忝金闺籍，尝见玉池莲。\n未若宗族地，更逢荣耀全。\n南金虽自贵，贺赏讵能迁。\n抚躬万里绝，岂染一朝妍。\n徒缘滞遐郡，常是惜流年。\n越俗鄙章甫，扪心空自怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}